      "Reserving sits at the intersection of analytical rigour and professional accountability that defines the profession: high-stakes, time-bound, judgement-intensive, with regulatory consequences that follow the actuary individually. Agentic AI is therefore approached carefully here, and where deployed it supports rather than substitutes for the appointed actuary's judgement. Automated reserve estimation applies chain ladder, Bornhuetter-Ferguson, Cape Cod and frequency-severity approaches to the same triangle and produces a structured comparison of estimates and ranges. The agent does not select the method; it presents the alternatives and their results.",
